      "values": []
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "e480b6a8-55e5-47e5-b23f-32649fc55160",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E4* hotel\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursions \u0026amp; guided tours included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHalf board accommodation\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIncluded lunch in palazzo at Lecce\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EProfessional tour manager\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flights to Italy\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach in Italy\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOne free place per 10 paying passengers\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "What\u0027s included in this tour is entirely yours to customise to suit your group\u0027s budget and preferences. Here is what we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "37f8ea74-fe9f-4ed6-a7a3-1a750e219838",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ESeven nights at the 4* Grand Hotel la Chiusa di Chietri. Located 2km from the UNESCO listed historical centre of Alberobello, facilities at the hotel include a restaurant, bar and a swimming pool. Dinner is served in our hotel on the first six evenings and there is a farewell dinner at a Masseria farmhouse on our last night.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Where you stay is entirely yours to choose to match your group\u0027s preferences. Here is our suggested accommodation:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "9ee6e2e4-3b73-423e-aa9f-5890ef670e8a",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELocorotondo \u0026amp; the church of Santa Maria della Greco\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWine tasting\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETrulli houses of Alberobello - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECattedrale di San Nicola Pellegrino in Trani\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECastel del Monte\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESassi dwellings at Matera - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAltamura\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOstuni - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMartina Franca\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPink city\u2019 of Lecce - guided tour \u0026amp; included lunch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELimestone caves of Grotto di Castellana - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECoastal village of Polignano a Mare\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The places your group visits are exclusively yours to decide. Here are the main sights we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "d536a3c5-2ac4-4adf-8f05-3436bffa4a5d",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGravina - Frederick II\u2019s hunting lodge and the Monastery of San Sebastiano, famous for its cloisters\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPinacoteca de Nittis, Barlettaa - delightful palazzo housing a wonderful collection of works by the impressionist artist Giuseppe de Nittis who took part in the first Impressionist exhibition in 1874\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBari - guided tour takes in the 12th century Cathedral of San Sabino, the Castello Normanno-Svevo built for the Holy Roman emperor Frederick II and the Basilica di San Nicola, housing the remains of St Nicholas stolen from southern\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETrani - the magnificent Cattedrale di San Nicola is home to one of the largest crypts in the world and the Church of Ognissanti was built by the Knights Templar in the 12th century\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGioia del Colle - 12th century castle destroyed by William the Wicked of Sicily and then rebuilt in 1230 by Frederick II after his return from the Crusades\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBitonto - home to one of Puglia\u2019s most beautiful cathedrals (dated between 1175 and 1200) with a fa\u00E7ade that features a richly decorated prothyrum and rose window, while the rest of the old medieval town centre features impressive Renaissance and Baroque buildings\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "\nIf you\u0027d prefer to visit different places, or if you\u0027d like to add extra attractions that match your group\u0027s specific interests, here are some more suggestions:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "fe56a1e5-d294-4ab8-ac17-206b7f2d89c7",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 - Puglia\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flight to Italy from your preferred airport \u2013 transfer with our tour manager in our private executive coach to the 4* Grand Hotel la Chiusa di Chietri on the outskirts of Alberobello.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Locorotondo, wine tasting \u0026amp; Alberobello\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAt Locorotondo, perched on a hill overlooking the fertile Valle d\u2019Itria, we visit the beautiful church of Santa Maria della Greca \u2013 an included wine tasting at a local winery \u2013 guided tour of Alberobello to see the white washed conical shaped trulli houses for which the Puglia region is famous.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 Cattedrale di San Nicola Pellegrino in Trani \u0026amp; Castel del Monte\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe magnificent Cattedrale di San Nicola Pellegrino in Trani occupies a prominent position next to the clear waters of the Adriatic and has one of the largest crypts in the world \u2013 the World Heritage site of Castel del Monte features an unusual octagonal layout and eight equally octagonal towers, built in the 13th century as a monument for Emperor Frederick II.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013 Matera guided tour \u0026amp; Altamura\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA guided tour explores Matera\u2019s Sassi dwellings which are carved out of the rock and are believed to be the best example of cave dwelling in the Mediterranean \u2013 Altamura was founded by Frederick II and is home to a magnificent cathedral dating from the 1300\u2019s and the Museo Archeologico housing finds from Neolithic times.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 \u2013 Ostuni guided tour \u0026amp; Martina Franca\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of delightful Ostuni, stretched over three hilltops and providing extraordinary views with its whitewashed houses standing out against the pink tinged brown of its principal buildings \u2013 Martina Franca\u2019s jewel is its picturesque historic centre with a memorable maze of winding alleys, where whitewashed simplicity sits side by side with Baroque extravagance.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 6 \u2013 Lecce guided tour \u0026amp; included lunch\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Baroque architecture in the \u2018pink city\u2019 of Lecce and the Roman Amphitheatre \u2013 included light buffet lunch in Lecce in an historic palazzo \u2013 time to wander at your leisure through the piazzas, market and winding streets or to enjoy the serenity of the 16th century Basilica della Santa Croce.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 7 \u2013 Grotto di Castellana, Polignano a Mare \u0026amp; farewell dinner\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of the Grotto di Castellana, a complex of underground limestone caves and caverns estimated to be 50 million years old \u2013 Polignano a Mare is dramatically located on top of cliffs overlooking the clear waters of the Adriatic \u2013included farewell dinner for a taste of the typical flavours of Puglia.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 8 \u2013 Puglia\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETransfer to the airport for our scheduled flight back home.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Your itinerary is exclusively yours to tailor to suit your group\u0027s interests and profile of your members. Here is our suggested itinerary:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "Remember, every element of this itinerary can be adjusted. If you\u0027d like to change the days, add different activities, or adjust the pace, just let us know."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
